From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dmstyle: style, motif and audition track Play send the notes and curves of the patterns

The style and motif tracks logged a FIXME and sent nothing. Play now:
- picks the pattern at each pattern boundary from the command in effect (command track of the segment: groove level, normal /
  fill / intro / break / end / end-and-intro embellishment; an embellishment the style lacks falls back to a groove) among the
  patterns whose groove range holds the level, with a seeded (GUID_SeedVariations) deterministic choice between candidates;
- for each part reference of the pattern picks a variation (variation choices, variation lock ids shared between parts, random or
  sequential order), and sends the notes and curves of that variation as DMUS_NOTE_PMSG / DMUS_CURVE_PMSG in music time
  (grid -> time with the beat and grids per beat of the part, plus the time offset of the note and the segment offset), for
  [start, end) only, loops parts shorter than the pattern, and fills measure/beat/grid, durations, velocities, ranges, channel;
- computes bMidiValue from the play mode (fixed, fixed-to-key/chord, melodic, normal chord, pedal point...) and the chord of the
  chord track in effect at the time of each note (chord roots, chord and scale patterns, sub chord level);
- plays a motif by name from time zero; a style item plays from its time to the next style item.
The audition track has no loadable data, so its Play sends nothing and no longer logs a FIXME.
Without a command or chord track groove level 1 and a C major chord apply (assumption, see the note).
---
diff --git a/dlls/dmstyle/auditiontrack.c b/dlls/dmstyle/auditiontrack.c
index f4dad1b..68d7cf0 100644
--- a/dlls/dmstyle/auditiontrack.c
+++ b/dlls/dmstyle/auditiontrack.c
@@ -122,10 +122,10 @@ static HRESULT WINAPI audition_track_Play(IDirectMusicTrack8 *iface, void *state
 {
     IDirectMusicAuditionTrack *This = impl_from_IDirectMusicTrack8(iface);
 
-    FIXME("(%p, %p, %ld, %ld, %ld, %#lx, %p, %p, %ld): the notes of the patterns are not "
-            "generated\n", This, state_data, start_time, end_time, time_offset, flags,
-            performance, segment_state, track_id);
+    TRACE("(%p, %p, %ld, %ld, %ld, %#lx, %p, %p, %ld)\n", This, state_data, start_time, end_time,
+            time_offset, flags, performance, segment_state, track_id);
 
+    /* the data of an audition track cannot be loaded (Load logs it), so there is nothing to play */
     if (!performance) return E_POINTER;
     return S_OK;
 }
